ive exist, so ops must confirm. No restore appears necessary since I observed no changes.\", \"i_attempted_writes\": false}\n```"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1291, "cache_read_input_tokens": 11951, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1291}, "output_tokens": 9, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "fc555bc3-d251-4e7f-878c-fce08230a085", "uuid": "3df47ebf-eee7-4978-93c0-ef75603e5dd6", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T13:28:12.193Z", "request_id": "req_011CgcHacPVmQoT2x2DiB11d"}
